# Pricing for the warehouse example: one line's total under a pricing rule, and
# an order's total under the list-price rule or the bulk-discount rule. The rules
# are operations passed by reference, so `orderTotal` is written once.

pricing is module
pricing purpose "Price order lines under a pricing rule, and total whole orders"
pricing path pricing
pricing imports standard.math
pricing imports standard.compare
pricing imports standard.list
pricing imports standard.test
pricing exports LineItem
pricing exports Lines
pricing exports PricingError
pricing exports listTotal
pricing exports discountTotal

LineItem is record
LineItem purpose "One line of an order: which item, how many, and the price of one in cents"
LineItem typeParameter none
LineItem field sku Int64
LineItem field quantity Int64
LineItem field unitCents Int64

Lines is typeInstance
Lines purpose "The lines of one order, in the order they were added"
Lines in none
Lines instantiates list.List LineItem

PricingError is enum
PricingError purpose "Why an order could not be priced, with what the caller needs to report it"
PricingError typeParameter none
PricingError variant negativeQuantity Int64
PricingError variant emptyOrder none

PriceRule is operationType
PriceRule purpose "A rule that turns a gross amount in cents into the amount charged"
PriceRule typeParameter none
PriceRule input cents Int64 copied
PriceRule output Int64
PriceRule outputOwnedBy none
PriceRule raises none
PriceRule effect none
PriceRule async false

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the two rules

fullPrice is operation
fullPrice purpose "Charge the gross amount unchanged"
fullPrice invariant unchanged "Returns the amount it was given"
fullPrice typeParameter none
fullPrice input cents Int64 copied
fullPrice output Int64
fullPrice outputOwnedBy none
fullPrice raises none
fullPrice effect none
fullPrice uses none
fullPrice memoryHeap false
fullPrice async false
fullPrice maxRecursion none
fullPrice label begin loopKind none
fullPrice label begin within none
fullPrice let none
fullPrice at begin return ok cents

bulkDiscount is operation
bulkDiscount purpose "Charge nine tenths of the gross amount, rounded down to whole cents"
bulkDiscount invariant tenPercentOff "Returns the amount times nine, divided by ten, rounded toward zero"
bulkDiscount typeParameter none
bulkDiscount input cents Int64 copied
bulkDiscount output Int64
bulkDiscount outputOwnedBy none
bulkDiscount raises none
bulkDiscount effect none
bulkDiscount uses none
bulkDiscount memoryHeap false
bulkDiscount async false
bulkDiscount maxRecursion none
bulkDiscount label begin loopKind none
bulkDiscount label begin within none
bulkDiscount let nine Int64 9 immutable
bulkDiscount let ten Int64 10 immutable
bulkDiscount at begin do timesNine
bulkDiscount at begin do byTen
bulkDiscount at begin return ok discounted

timesNine is call
timesNine in bulkDiscount
timesNine invokes math.multiplyInt64
timesNine argument left Int64 cents copy
timesNine argument right Int64 nine copy
timesNine result ninefold Int64
timesNine ownedBy none
timesNine cleanedBy none
timesNine borrows none
timesNine catch none
timesNine suppresses none

byTen is call
byTen in bulkDiscount
byTen invokes math.divideInt64
byTen argument left Int64 ninefold copy
byTen argument right Int64 ten copy
byTen result discounted Int64
byTen ownedBy none
byTen cleanedBy none
byTen borrows none
byTen catch none
byTen suppresses none

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- one line

lineTotal is operation
lineTotal purpose "Price one line: quantity times unit price, then the rule"
lineTotal invariant ruleOfGross "Returns the rule applied to quantity times unit price"
lineTotal invariant rejectsNegative "A negative quantity is a negativeQuantity error carrying the line's sku"
lineTotal typeParameter none
lineTotal input item LineItem copied
lineTotal input rule PriceRule copied
lineTotal output Int64
lineTotal outputOwnedBy none
lineTotal raises PricingError
lineTotal effect none
lineTotal uses none
lineTotal memoryHeap false
lineTotal async false
lineTotal maxRecursion none
lineTotal label begin loopKind none
lineTotal label begin within none
lineTotal label reject loopKind none
lineTotal label reject within none
lineTotal label charge loopKind none
lineTotal label charge within none
lineTotal let zero Int64 0 immutable
lineTotal at begin do readQuantity
lineTotal at begin do checkSign
lineTotal at begin branch if isNegative goto reject else goto charge
lineTotal at reject do readSku
lineTotal at reject do makeNegative
lineTotal at reject return error negativeError
lineTotal at charge do readUnit
lineTotal at charge do gross
lineTotal at charge do applyRule
lineTotal at charge return ok charged

readQuantity is call
readQuantity in lineTotal
readQuantity invokes LineItem.quantity
readQuantity argument record LineItem item copy
readQuantity result quantity Int64
readQuantity ownedBy none
readQuantity cleanedBy none
readQuantity borrows none
readQuantity catch none
readQuantity suppresses none

checkSign is call
checkSign in lineTotal
checkSign invokes compare.lessThanInt64
checkSign argument left Int64 quantity copy
checkSign argument right Int64 zero copy
checkSign result isNegative Bool
checkSign ownedBy none
checkSign cleanedBy none
checkSign borrows none
checkSign catch none
checkSign suppresses none

readSku is call
readSku in lineTotal
readSku invokes LineItem.sku
readSku argument record LineItem item copy
readSku result sku Int64
readSku ownedBy none
readSku cleanedBy none
readSku borrows none
readSku catch none
readSku suppresses none

makeNegative is call
makeNegative in lineTotal
makeNegative invokes PricingError.negativeQuantity
makeNegative argument payload Int64 sku copy
makeNegative result negativeError PricingError
makeNegative ownedBy none
makeNegative cleanedBy none
makeNegative borrows none
makeNegative catch none
makeNegative suppresses none

readUnit is call
readUnit in lineTotal
readUnit invokes LineItem.unitCents
readUnit argument record LineItem item copy
readUnit result unitCents Int64
readUnit ownedBy none
readUnit cleanedBy none
readUnit borrows none
readUnit catch none
readUnit suppresses none

gross is call
gross in lineTotal
gross invokes math.multiplyInt64
gross argument left Int64 quantity copy
gross argument right Int64 unitCents copy
gross result grossCents Int64
gross ownedBy none
gross cleanedBy none
gross borrows none
gross catch none
gross suppresses none

applyRule is call
applyRule in lineTotal
applyRule invokesReference rule
applyRule argument cents Int64 grossCents copy
applyRule result charged Int64
applyRule ownedBy none
applyRule cleanedBy none
applyRule borrows none
applyRule catch none
applyRule suppresses none

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- a whole order

orderTotal is operation
orderTotal purpose "Price every line of an order under one rule and add the results"
orderTotal invariant sumOfLines "Returns the sum of lineTotal over every line, under the given rule"
orderTotal invariant rejectsEmpty "An order with no lines is an emptyOrder error"
orderTotal typeParameter none
orderTotal input lines Lines borrowed
orderTotal input rule PriceRule copied
orderTotal output Int64
orderTotal outputOwnedBy none
orderTotal raises PricingError
orderTotal effect none
orderTotal uses none
orderTotal memoryHeap false
orderTotal async false
orderTotal maxRecursion none
orderTotal label begin loopKind none
orderTotal label begin within none
orderTotal label rejectEmpty loopKind none
orderTotal label rejectEmpty within none
orderTotal label sumLines loopKind forEach
orderTotal label sumLines within none
orderTotal label sumLines maxIterations lineCount
orderTotal label sumLines over lines
orderTotal label priceLine loopKind none
orderTotal label priceLine within sumLines
orderTotal label addLine loopKind none
orderTotal label addLine within sumLines
orderTotal label passUp loopKind none
orderTotal label passUp within none
orderTotal label done loopKind none
orderTotal label done within none
orderTotal let zero Int64 0 immutable
orderTotal let running Int64 0 mutable
orderTotal at begin do countLines
orderTotal at begin do checkEmpty
orderTotal at begin branch if isEmpty goto rejectEmpty else goto sumLines
orderTotal at rejectEmpty do makeEmpty
orderTotal at rejectEmpty return error emptyError
orderTotal at sumLines branch ifNext lines bind line LineItem goto priceLine else goto done
orderTotal at priceLine do priceIt
orderTotal at priceLine branch ifError priceIt goto passUp else goto addLine
orderTotal at addLine do accumulate
orderTotal at addLine set running newRunning
orderTotal at addLine goto sumLines
orderTotal at passUp return error lineError
orderTotal at done return ok running

countLines is call
countLines in orderTotal
countLines invokes Lines.length
countLines argument list Lines lines lend
countLines result lineCount Int64
countLines ownedBy none
countLines cleanedBy none
countLines borrows none
countLines catch none
countLines suppresses none

checkEmpty is call
checkEmpty in orderTotal
checkEmpty invokes compare.equalInt64
checkEmpty argument left Int64 lineCount copy
checkEmpty argument right Int64 zero copy
checkEmpty result isEmpty Bool
checkEmpty ownedBy none
checkEmpty cleanedBy none
checkEmpty borrows none
checkEmpty catch none
checkEmpty suppresses none

makeEmpty is call
makeEmpty in orderTotal
makeEmpty invokes PricingError.emptyOrder
makeEmpty argument none
makeEmpty result emptyError PricingError
makeEmpty ownedBy none
makeEmpty cleanedBy none
makeEmpty borrows none
makeEmpty catch none
makeEmpty suppresses none

priceIt is call
priceIt in orderTotal
priceIt invokes lineTotal
priceIt argument item LineItem line copy
priceIt argument rule PriceRule rule copy
priceIt result lineAmount Int64
priceIt ownedBy none
priceIt cleanedBy none
priceIt borrows none
priceIt catch lineError PricingError
priceIt suppresses none

accumulate is call
accumulate in orderTotal
accumulate invokes math.addInt64
accumulate argument left Int64 running copy
accumulate argument right Int64 lineAmount copy
accumulate result newRunning Int64
accumulate ownedBy none
accumulate cleanedBy none
accumulate borrows none
accumulate catch none
accumulate suppresses none

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- what other modules call

listTotal is operation
listTotal purpose "Total an order at list price"
listTotal invariant atListPrice "Returns orderTotal of the lines under fullPrice"
listTotal typeParameter none
listTotal input lines Lines borrowed
listTotal output Int64
listTotal outputOwnedBy none
listTotal raises PricingError
listTotal effect none
listTotal uses none
listTotal memoryHeap false
listTotal async false
listTotal maxRecursion none
listTotal label begin loopKind none
listTotal label begin within none
listTotal label passUp loopKind none
listTotal label passUp within none
listTotal label done loopKind none
listTotal label done within none
listTotal let rule PriceRule fullPrice immutable
listTotal at begin do total
listTotal at begin branch ifError total goto passUp else goto done
listTotal at passUp return error totalError
listTotal at done return ok amount

total is call
total in listTotal
total invokes orderTotal
total argument lines Lines lines lend
total argument rule PriceRule rule copy
total result amount Int64
total ownedBy none
total cleanedBy none
total borrows none
total catch totalError PricingError
total suppresses none

discountTotal is operation
discountTotal purpose "Total an order with the bulk discount on every line"
discountTotal invariant atDiscount "Returns orderTotal of the lines under bulkDiscount"
discountTotal typeParameter none
discountTotal input lines Lines borrowed
discountTotal output Int64
discountTotal outputOwnedBy none
discountTotal raises PricingError
discountTotal effect none
discountTotal uses none
discountTotal memoryHeap false
discountTotal async false
discountTotal maxRecursion none
discountTotal label begin loopKind none
discountTotal label begin within none
discountTotal label passUp loopKind none
discountTotal label passUp within none
discountTotal label done loopKind none
discountTotal label done within none
discountTotal let rule PriceRule bulkDiscount immutable
discountTotal at begin do total
discountTotal at begin branch ifError total goto passUp else goto done
discountTotal at passUp return error totalError
discountTotal at done return ok amount

total is call
total in discountTotal
total invokes orderTotal
total argument lines Lines lines lend
total argument rule PriceRule rule copy
total result amount Int64
total ownedBy none
total cleanedBy none
total borrows none
total catch totalError PricingError
total suppresses none
